###
GET {{host}}/products

###
GET {{host}}/products?name=a&brandName=f&minPrice=50&maxPrice=3000&inStock=true&sortBy=price&sortDir=desc&page=0&size=5

###
GET {{host}}/products?sortBy=brand&sortDir=asc

###
POST {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
